flowchart TD
    A[Launch ListFlick] --> B{Authenticated?}

    B -->|No| C[Sign In / Create Account]
    C --> D[Home]
    B -->|Yes| D

    D --> E[Take Photos / Choose from Library]
    D --> I[Inventory]
    D --> S[Settings]

    %% First-time AI configuration
    S --> P{AI provider selected?}

    P -->|No| P1[Choose AI Provider]
    P1 --> P2{Gemini or Groq}
    P2 -->|Gemini| P3[Add Gemini API Key]
    P2 -->|Groq| P4[Add Groq API Key]

    P3 --> S
    P4 --> S

    P -->|Yes| PK{Selected provider key configured?}
    PK -->|No| P5[Add Selected Provider API Key]
    P5 --> S
    PK -->|Yes| S

    %% Listing creation
    E --> K{AI configured?}

    K -->|No provider selected| K1[API Key Required]
    K1 -->|Open Settings| S

    K -->|Provider selected but key missing| K2[Provider API Key Required]
    K2 -->|Add API Key| P5

    K -->|Ready| F[Analyze Photos]
    F --> G[Processing]
    G --> H[Listing Preview]

    %% Review workspace
    H --> J[Edit Listing]
    J --> H

    H --> M[Manage Photos]
    M --> H

    H --> N[Improve with AI]
    N --> H

    H --> O[Save to Inventory]
    O --> I

    %% Saved listing flow
    I --> L[View Saved Listing]

    L --> J2[Edit Listing]
    J2 --> L

    L --> M2[Manage Photos]
    M2 --> L

    L --> Q[Save Photos to Device]
    L --> R[Copy Listing Text / Share to Chat]

    L --> T[Delete / Recently Deleted]
